  "caveats": [
    "Hobby $30/month ($25/month billed yearly, $300/year) with $30 credits; Startup $300/month ($250 yearly, $3,000/year) with $300 credits; Free $0 with $5 credits; Enterprise from $1,000/month. There is NO runtime/CPU/RAM meter. The credit pool (1 credit = $0.01) is drawn by: requests (MCP tools/call only) $0.10 per 1,000; build minutes $0.07/min; bandwidth egress $0.15/GB; eval runs $1; publishing checklist $0.10/run; end-to-end checks $2/run; submission pack $5; managed-chat LLM output $5 per 1M tokens. Rates are the same on every plan.",
    "Null values mean unknown, not free/unlimited. No model-token cost, tax or unverified ancillary charge included.",
    "Native browser/device/task/credit prices with unknown CPU/RAM are deliberately non-priceable. Check regime before interpreting any partial resource estimate."
  ],
